<title>USA: Liposome stake raised by Kenneth Dart.</title>
<headline>Liposome stake raised by Kenneth Dart.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by Kenneth Dart, president of Dart Container Corp, said late Tuesday it raised its stake in Liposome Co. Inc's outstanding Series A common shares to 10.98 percent or 3,974,346 shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it bought 775,000 shares of the Princeton, N.J. drug company between April 11 and April 14 at $18.88 to $20.88 each.</p>
